title: August 2025

@presidential_oath_crisis_2025
# prose-audit: Grade A — Hołownia's reported approach remains an allegation, the constitutional offices retain their powers, and the playable delay succeeds only as a temporary, ruinous interregnum.
title: War of the Powers — the other oath
subtitle: Hołownia is urged to withhold the National Assembly after [+ pres_2025_right_surname +]'s victory
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 45
order: 4
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month >= 8 and pres_2025_runoff_done = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "right" and pres_2025_inaugurated = 0 and pres_2025_oath_crisis = 0 and government_party != "pis" and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and sejm_speaker = "Szymon Hołownia"
on-arrival: {!
Q.public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_salience += 18;
Q.public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_support += -6;
Q.news_headline = "An unnamed approach asks Hołownia to delay " +
    Q.pres_2025_right_surname + "'s oath";
!}

= August 2025 — The date belongs to the Constitution

The official count gives <span class="party-pis"><b>[+ pres_2025_right_candidate +]</b></span> the presidency and the Supreme
Court has ruled on the election's validity. Complaints about individual
precincts can still be examined; Sejm Marshal <span class="party-p2050"><b>Szymon Hołownia</b></span> does not
gain authority to recertify the national result.

People Hołownia will not name urge him to withhold the National Assembly on
6 August. If the outgoing President's term expires before **[+
pres_2025_right_surname +]** takes the oath, they
argue, Article 131 lets the Marshal temporarily discharge presidential duties.
No evidence establishes a collective coalition plan. The proposal is now in
the room, however, and every party must decide whether to kill it, discipline
it into lawful review or try it.

[? if left_in_government: Lewica's ministers can lend the proposal coalition
authority or make the Council of Ministers reject it in writing.?][? if not
left_in_government: Lewica holds no cabinet office. It can expose the approach,
support a lawful evidence process or add parliamentary votes and public cover
to the delay; it cannot order the Marshal or the Supreme Court.?]

- @oath_fixed_date_2025
- @oath_audit_2025
- @oath_delay_2025
- @oath_acting_window_2025

@oath_fixed_date_2025
title: Reject the approach and publish the 6 August sitting
subtitle: Preserve the result and force every coalition leader to sign the refusal.
on-arrival: pres_2025_oath_crisis = 1; pres_2025_oath_strategy = "Fixed constitutional date"; constitutional_restraint += 7; government_procedural_restraint += 6; judicial_legitimacy += 4; institutional_trust += 4; public_trust += 3; p2050_relation += 5; pis_relation += 2; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Hołownia rejects the delay and publishes the oath sitting"

Hołownia publishes the sitting and the coalition council records that no
party may use parliamentary scheduling to alter a presidential result. PiS
loses the grievance it expected to carry into the streets; coalition figures
who wanted more time begin briefing against the Marshal instead.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the elected President reach the oath

@oath_audit_2025
title: Review named precincts without moving the oath
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Separate evidence and court remedies from the constitutional date.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A parallel precinct audit requires one party resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.pres_2025_oath_crisis = 1;
Q.pres_2025_oath_strategy = "Targeted review without delay";
Q.judicial_legitimacy += 6;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 5;
Q.institutional_trust += 3;
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.pis_relation -= 2;
Q.p2050_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "A published precinct audit proceeds without delaying " +
    Q.pres_2025_right_surname + "'s oath";
!}

Election lawyers publish each protested commission, the ballots at issue and
the remedy requested. Hołownia keeps the National Assembly date. Suspicion is
not silenced, but no institution receives a power it did not possess before
the close count.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the audit and oath on separate tracks

@oath_delay_2025
title: Withhold the sitting and claim a temporary interregnum
subtitle: The manoeuvre works for days, then collapses; institutional and foreign relations take the blow.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pres_2025_oath_crisis = 2;
Q.pres_2025_oath_strategy = "Temporary acting claim";
Q.president_name = "Presidential office disputed during oath delay";
Q.public_trust -= 12;
Q.institutional_trust -= 14;
Q.constitutional_restraint -= 18;
Q.government_procedural_restraint -= 18;
Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 10;
Q.supreme_court_chamber_recognition -= 8;
Q.oath_crisis_pressure += 42;
Q.foreign_pressure += 20;
Q.eu_institutional_trust -= 16;
Q.eu_influence -= 10;
Q.us_rule_of_law_pressure += 12;
Q.us_alliance_reliability -= 8;
Q.us_ambassador_channel -= 10;
Q.us_congress_channel -= 8;
Q.us_defence_channel -= 5;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 16;
Q.p2050_coalition_dissent += 20;
Q.early_election_risk += 18;
Q.p2050_relation -= 8;
Q.pis_relation -= 12;
Q.president_relation -= 15;
Q.far_right_agenda += 8;
Q.pis_poll_momentum += 0.8;
Q.news_headline =
    "Hołownia withholds the oath and claims temporary presidential duties";
!}

The sitting is not convened. The outgoing President's term expires and Hołownia claims that the
failure to assume office activates the Marshal's temporary duties. **[+
pres_2025_right_surname +]**,
PiS and much of the legal profession answer that the Marshal manufactured the
very obstacle on which his claim depends.

The manoeuvre has therefore worked in the narrowest sense: no elected
President occupies the Palace and government lawyers route urgent papers to a
disputed acting authority. It cannot award Hołownia a term or invalidate the
count. EU partners and Washington keep treaty channels open but postpone
senior decisions until Poland identifies one constitutional signature.

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the interregnum's compulsory end

@oath_acting_window_2025
title: Use the acting window for appointments and the court bill
subtitle: The acts are frozen and [+ pres_2025_right_surname +] still takes office; this is the maximum constitutional rupture.
