Q.news_headline =
    "The disputed acting window is used for appointments and a court bill";
!}

Government lawyers send the pending court bill and appointment papers through
Hołownia's disputed office. Ministries receive signatures; courts immediately
freeze their effect, civil servants demand indemnities and **[+
pres_2025_right_surname +]** announces
that every act will be challenged on his first day.

The government has briefly done the unspecified thing for which the delay was
supposed to create time. It has not made any policy durable. Coalition
defections and allied pressure now make the oath unavoidable while leaving a
second archive of contested appointments inside the state.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the certified result close the acting window

@presidential_inauguration_2025
# prose-audit: Grade B — The oath now establishes the named President's relationship with the live prime minister and Lewica's actual office, and all government/opposition postures receive authored consequences.
title: A new president takes the oath
subtitle: The veto regime for the second half of the campaign
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 30
order: 5
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month >= 8 and pres_2025_runoff_done = 1 and pres_2025_inaugurated = 0 and (pres_2025_oath_crisis != 0 or pres_2025_winner_key != "right" or government_party = "pis" or government_has_confidence = 0 or caretaker_government = 1 or sejm_speaker != "Szymon Hołownia")
on-arrival: {!
const oathDelayCollapsed = Number(Q.pres_2025_oath_crisis) == 2;
Q.president_name = Q.pres_2025_winner;
Q.pres_2025_inaugurated = 1;
Q.left_president = ["left", "razem"].includes(Q.pres_2025_winner_key) ? 1 : 0;
if (oathDelayCollapsed) {
    Q.pres_2025_oath_crisis = 3;
    Q.oath_crisis_pressure = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.oath_crisis_pressure) || 0) - 8
    );
}
if (Q.pres_2025_hostile_president) {
    Q.president_relation = Math.min(
        Number(Q.president_relation) || 20,
        24
    );
    Q.president_judiciary_cooperation -= 8;
    Q.news_headline = oathDelayCollapsed
        ? Q.president_name + " takes the oath after the Marshal's delay collapses"
        : Q.president_name + " opens a hostile cohabitation";
} else {
    Q.president_relation += 10;
    Q.president_judiciary_cooperation += 12;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.president_name + " opens a cooperative presidency";
}
!}

= August 2025 — The pen changes hands

[? if pres_2025_oath_crisis = 3: The interregnum ends because it cannot
manufacture a different electoral judgment, a durable presidential act or a
coalition willing to defend it. Hołownia convenes the National Assembly under
threat of removal. [? if pres_2025_oath_strategy = "Disputed acts during the interregnum": Courts freeze the appointments and statute signed during the disputed window; their legal-dualism cost remains after the office changes hands.?][? if pres_2025_oath_strategy != "Disputed acts during the interregnum": The temporary acting claim produces no presidential act before the elected winner arrives.?]?]

**[+ president_name +]** takes the oath as President of the Republic while
Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** still depends on the same Sejm. The
ceremony changes who may sign, veto and refer a bill; it does not silently move
a single deputy or ministry.

[? if pres_2025_incumbent and pres_2025_winner = "Rafał Trzaskowski":
Trzaskowski begins a second term. The oath confirms that five years of
cohabitation were a governing fact, not an interlude: his veto record, signed
opposition bills and the PiS stress-versus-rally balance now carry into the new
Sejm cycle.?]
[? if pres_2025_hostile_president: The governing coalition still lacks the
three-fifths majority needed to override vetoes. Every labour, equality and
judicial bill now needs a Palace bargain, a workaround or a public defeat.?]
[? if not pres_2025_hostile_president: A friendly signature removes one veto
wall. It does not remove PSL, the Senate timetable, judicial dualism or the
coalition's own internal vetoes.?]

[? if left_in_government and caretaker_government = 0:
Lewica must decide whether its ministers negotiate every flagship text with
the Palace or turn each veto into the next campaign.?][? if not left_in_government or
caretaker_government = 1: Lewica cannot
speak for the cabinet. It can offer the President public hearings on its own
bills or build an opposition record of every signature, veto and referral.?]

- @palace_channels
- @palace_mandate
- @palace_opposition_channels
- @palace_opposition_veto_campaign

@palace_channels
title: Establish public consultation rules for every flagship bill
subtitle: Give the Palace influence before the vote in exchange for warning before a veto.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and caretaker_government = 0
on-arrival: presidential_channel_open = 1; president_relation += 5; president_judiciary_cooperation += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; government_delivery += 1; news_headline = "The cabinet's Palace channel receives written rules instead of ad hoc courtship"

The prime minister's office and President **[+ president_name +]** publish a
calendar for consultation, legal objections and final drafting. Lewica's
ministers gain warning before a veto and the Palace gains influence before the
Sejm vote. Cooperation becomes legible—and responsibility for failure harder
for either side to evade.

- @poland_event_queue: File the written Palace channel

@palace_mandate
title: Prepare to campaign over every veto
subtitle: Close the private channel, unite the cabinet and risk turning useful bills into campaign exhibits.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and caretaker_government = 0
on-arrival: presidential_channel_open = 0; public_trust += 1; media_capacity += 3; president_relation -= 6; government_coalition_dissent -= 1; far_right_agenda += 2; news_headline = "The governing coalition turns cohabitation into the next electoral mandate"

The coalition closes the private channel and prepares a public dossier for
every veto. Its parties gain a common opponent and stop bargaining against one
another for Palace access. Bills likely to fail can now become excellent
campaigns, which is not the same thing as laws workers or minorities can use.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the veto-campaign mandate

@palace_opposition_channels
title: Offer public Palace hearings for every Lewica bill and amendment
subtitle: Opposition route. Seek a hearing for Lewica's bills without pretending to direct the cabinet.
view-if: left_in_government = 0 or caretaker_government = 1
on-arrival: presidential_channel_open = 1; president_relation += 3; president_judiciary_cooperation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 3; media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica opens a public party-to-Palace channel without claiming to direct the cabinet"

Lewica invites President **[+ president_name +]** to public hearings with its
MPs, lawyers and affected constituencies. The party gains a route for its bills
and amendments without pretending it directs the Council of Ministers. The
Palace gains another stage on which to choose its distance from government.

- @poland_event_queue: File the opposition Palace hearings

@palace_opposition_veto_campaign
title: Build an opposition ledger around signatures, vetoes and referrals
subtitle: Opposition route. Trade access to the Palace for a documented campaign against its record.
view-if: left_in_government = 0 or caretaker_government = 1
on-arrival: presidential_channel_open = 0; public_trust += 1; media_capacity += 4; progressive_credibility += 2; president_relation -= 5; far_right_agenda += 1; news_headline = "Lewica campaigns on a documented veto ledger instead of speaking for the government"

Every signature, veto and referral receives a date, the affected bill and the
President's stated reason. Lewica can campaign on evidence rather than claiming
another party's cabinet programme. The Palace understands that even routine
decisions will now arrive in our next election leaflet.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the opposition veto ledger
